# Keep customer-roadmap source files trackable. The broad legacy 4-character
# folder ignore above catches docs/ and core/ unintentionally.
!docs/
docs/*
!docs/roadmap/
!docs/roadmap/*.md
!docs/api/
!docs/api/*.md
!docs/radius/
!docs/radius/*.md
