# Same 4-char-folder trap hit app/radius/auth/ — `auth` matches `????/`, so
# new modules created there (e.g. ui_permissions.py, the RBAC-UI layer that
# powers the sidebar's can()/perm_for_endpoint()) were silently never
# committed and went MISSING from production builds, freezing the whole
# sidebar even for the super admin. Keep the auth package fully trackable.
!app/radius/auth/
!app/radius/auth/*.py

